### Register a candidate
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register/candidat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Hassan Snoussi Jerbi",
  "email": "hassan@example.com",
  "motDePasse": "Password123",
  "telephone": "+21600000000",
  "localisation": "Bizerte"
}

### Register a recruiter (creates the company if it does not exist)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register/recruteur
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Sana Ben Ali",
  "email": "sana@acme.tn",
  "motDePasse": "Password123",
  "poste": "RH",
  "entrepriseNom": "Acme Tunisie",
  "entrepriseDescription": "Software company",
  "entrepriseSiteWeb": "https://acme.tn"
}

### Login (copy the token from the response)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hassan@example.com",
  "motDePasse": "Password123"
}

### Current user
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@smartrecruit.tn",
  "motDePasse": "Admin@12345"
}

### List users (admin only: 403 for other roles)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admin/utilisateurs
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
